AUTHOR'S HUMBLE REQUEST (NON-BINDING)

The author and developer respectfully ask anyone who contributes to,
continues, modifies, forks, or independently develops this project or a
derivative operating-system project to consider retaining the name
"Prosenjit" as part of the operating system's name.

This request is made with humility and in the spirit of respect for the
project's origin, identity, and development history. It is a request only:
it is not a condition of this MIT License, does not restrict anyone's rights
under the license, and creates no legal obligation to use the Prosenjit name.

Everyone remains free to choose a different name for their own fork or
independent project, subject to applicable third-party rights and law.
